  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:birkhot_hatorah/vehaarev">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkhot_hatorah/vehaarev/1"/>Adonoy our God, please make pleasant
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkhot_hatorah/vehaarev/2"/>the words of Your Torah in our mouths
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkhot_hatorah/vehaarev/3"/>and in the mouths of Your people Israel.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkhot_hatorah/vehaarev/4"/>And may we and our descendants
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkhot_hatorah/vehaarev/5"/>and the descendants of Your people
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkhot_hatorah/vehaarev/6"/>the House of Israel,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkhot_hatorah/vehaarev/7"/>all be perceivers of Your Name
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkhot_hatorah/vehaarev/8"/>and students of Your Torah for its own sake.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkhot_hatorah/vehaarev/9"/>Blessed are You, Adonoy
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:birkhot_hatorah/vehaarev/10"/>Who teaches Torah to His people, Israel.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
  </tei:text>
